# Frame and overlays: an Overlay with Offset on both sides, a size and Margin: auto is centered in its container.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Frame and overlays · Centering
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Section:
		Text: Frame and overlays
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Centering
		Paragraph: An `Overlay` with `Offset: 0`, a `Width` and a `Height` sets its position twice, which is an error. With `Margin: auto` the margins take the leftover space and the box is centered. `Margin: auto 0` centers it only vertically.
			Style: intro
		Text: Offset: 0, Width: 160, Height: 50, Margin: auto
			Style: label
